<p>Airline says crew did a â€œgreat jobâ€ after incident and that it has been in touch with family of man saved from death</p><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/live/2026/jul/20/oil-price-rises-us-iran-strikes-ryanair-lower-fares-summer-economy-latest-news-updates"><strong>Business live â€“ latest updates</strong></a></p></li></ul><p>Ryanair has moved to reassure travellers that its planes are safe after a passenger was saved from being <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/jul/10/ryanair-passenger-almost-sucked-out-of-shattered-window-during-flight">sucked out of a window mid-flight</a> and said it had been in touch with his family.</p><p>This month, Ljubisa KaroviÄ‡ was sucked out headfirst after an engine failure resulted in parts smashing an acrylic window during a flight from Thessaloniki in Greece to Memmingen near Munich in Germany.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/jul/20/ryanair-says-planes-safe-passenger-nearly-sucked-out-window">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;64YUD0HvWwKCAF5yPc1AnjHwzBy5lrCBe8Kjh5U_7i8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;YGkD4ToOXTpgZRbK0hHvd_4PaEN4_ZwUXsQQkEsHL6cƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;uUeWmVWU6vUBoQiwQDUBqngTrpwCH-BT98EX-JCGmNoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zCiSri5mRJ0jKayYvAnDK5o4Ca99Apa94qa6ZOzBHdIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-dCVlhZcak6jT8KEa-jEPnhTLTsjyPvDZJqSN2y12MIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;N2wvj0Qumv5l0A87jCTwYmIS821GpMFlA2-HtcYzOPwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumd